OL,3,GNEWSAHospital births yet to resume 18
OL,4,Amonths after pause
OL,5,
OL,6,FA date for the resumption of births at
OL,7,Fa hospital where some maternity
OL,8,Fservices were paused 18 months ago due
OL,9,Fto staffing issues remains unclear.
OL,11,FIn May 2025, North Tees and Hartlepool
OL,12,FNHS Foundation Trust said it would
OL,13,Fpause intrapartum care, the period from
OL,14,Fthe start of labour until delivery, at
OL,15,Fthe Rowan Suite at the University
OL,16,FHospital of Hartlepool.
OL,18,FThis suspension was only intended to be
OL,19,Fin place for three months, but was
OL,20,Flater extended twice.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
